    "text": "CONCLUDED\nLast Updated:\nUpdated 6 hours ago\nMusk Is Officially the World’s First Trillionaire\nSpaceX shares surged after the company's Nasdaq debut Friday, giving the company a market capitalization of more than $2 trillion.\nThat values Musk's stake at roughly $1.1 trillion. Combined with his Tesla position and other assets, Musk is worth about $1.4 trillion, according to Barron's estimates.\nHe's the richest person on the planet and worth more than the next four billionaires combined: Larry Page, Sergey Brin, Jeff Bezos, and Larry Ellison.",
